/T (Literature shows that traditional stopword removal is often sub-optimal for embedding-based models, since these models rely on the full syntactic structure of the input text. In our study, we  evaluate the impact of different stopword strategies, including a domain-specific stopword list generated in a data-driven way using another banking app reviews dataset, to assess whether domain knowledge can provide benefits.)
